  "blocks": [],
  "parts": [
    {
      "id": "part-000428-01",
      "label": "(1)",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "$\\mathrm{CH_4(g) + H_2O(g) \\rightleftharpoons CO(g) + 3H_2(g)}$"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "part-000428-02",
      "label": "(2)",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "$\\mathrm{2CH_4(g) + O_2(g) \\rightarrow 2CO(g) + 4H_2(g)}$"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "$\\mathrm{(3) \\quad CO(g) + H_2O(g) \\rightarrow H_2(g) + CO_2(g)}$"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "假设反应产生的CO全部转化为 $\\mathrm{CO_2}$,$\\mathrm{CO_2}$ 被碱液完全吸收,剩余的 $\\mathrm{H_2O}$ 通过冷凝干燥除去。进入合成氨反应塔的原料气为纯净的 $\\mathrm{N_2}$ 和 $\\mathrm{H_2}$。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "part-000428-03",
      "label": "1-1",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "为使原料气中 $\\mathrm{N_2}$ 和 $\\mathrm{H_2}$ 的体积比为 1:3,推出起始气体中 $\\mathrm{CH_4}$ 和空气的比例。设空气中 $\\mathrm{O_2}$ 和 $\\mathrm{N_2}$ 的体积比为 1:4,所有气体均按理想气体处理。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "part-000428-04",
      "label": "1-2",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "计算反应(2)的反应热。已知:"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "$\\mathrm{C(s) + 2H_2(g) \\rightarrow CH_4(g) \\quad \\Delta H_4 = -74.8\\, kJ\\, mol^{-1}} \\tag{4}$"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "$\\mathrm{C(s) + \\frac{1}{2}O_2(g) \\rightarrow CO(g) \\quad \\Delta H_5 = -110.5\\, kJ\\, mol^{-1}} \\tag{5}$"
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
